*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.slx binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.onnx binary
*.h5 binary
*.keras binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.whl binary
